          <p data-block-key="yu3nj"><i>Predicted training loss for different settings of data/privacy/compute budget, and a further detailed breakdown by the number of iterations, batch size, and model size. The plots show both the minimum achievable loss for different budget settings, along with the optimal hyper-parameter configurations.</i></p>
